<p class="sw-ratio small">6.7:1 on background · 5.9:1 on surface</p></div></article></div></section>
<section id="type"><h2 class="h2">Typography</h2><p class="lede">DM Sans throughout. Apply each style with its class, e.g. <code>class="body"</code>.</p><h3 class="h4 sub">Headings</h3><div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec"><span class="tok">h1</span><span class="small muted">40px / 48px · 700</span></div>
<div><p class="h1 type-sample">Train your design muscles</p><p class="caption muted">Page titles and hero headings. One per page; around 32px on small screens.</p></div></div><div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec"><span class="tok">h2</span><span class="small muted">32px / 40px · 700</span></div>
<div><p class="h2 type-sample">This week&#x27;s workouts</p><p class="caption muted">Main section headings.</p></div></div><div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec"><span class="tok">h3</span><span class="small muted">24px / 32px · 600</span></div>
<div><p class="h3 type-sample">Critique drills</p><p class="caption muted">Subsection headings.</p></div></div><div class="type-row"><div class="type-spec"><span class="tok">h4</span><span class="small muted">20px / 28px · 600</span></div>
