<section id="components"><h2 class="h2">Components</h2><p class="lede">Plain CSS classes prefixed <code>pdg-</code>, styled entirely from tokens.</p><article class="comp" id="c-button"><h3 class="h3">Button</h3><div class="stage"><div class="pdg-stack">
  <button class="body pdg-btn pdg-btn--primary">Start workout</button>
  <button class="body pdg-btn pdg-btn--secondary">Preview brief</button>
  <button class="body pdg-btn pdg-btn--ghost">Skip for now</button>
  <button class="body pdg-btn pdg-btn--destructive">Delete workout</button>
  <button class="body pdg-btn" disabled>Submitted</button>
</div></div><div class="guide body"><p>Triggers an action; one visually dominant primary button per screen or task area.</p>
<p><strong>Markup:</strong> <code>&lt;button class="body pdg-btn pdg-btn--primary"&gt;Start workout&lt;/button&gt;</code> — the <code>body</code> type style sets the label size; the button adds weight 600. Variants: <code>--primary</code>, <code>--secondary</code>, <code>--ghost</code>, <code>--destructive</code>. Disable with <code>disabled</code> (or <code>aria-disabled="true"</code> on a link).</p>
<p><strong>You provide:</strong> the label (a verb first: "Start workout", "Submit critique"), an optional leading icon with <code>aria-hidden="true"</code>, and the click handler.</p>
<ul>
<li>Primary: <code>primary</code> fill, <code>on-primary</code> label, <code>primary-hover</code> on hover. Never white text on <code>primary</code>.</li>
<li>Secondary: transparent with a <code>text-muted</code> outline (11.3:1) — used for everything that is not the main action.</li>
<li>Ghost: <code>primary</code> text for low-emphasis actions inside cards and toolbars.</li>
<li>Destructive: <code>error</code> fill with <code>on-primary</code> label; name what is destroyed ("Delete workout").</li>
<li><code>radius-2</code>, 40px tall, <code>space-4</code> horizontal padding, <code>space-2</code> between icon and label.</li>
<li><code>border-width</code> outline (transparent unless secondary or disabled). Focus: <code>focus-ring-width</code> <code>primary</code> ring, 2px offset.</li>
</ul>
<p>Don't put two primary buttons side by side, and don't use <code>primary-hover</code> as a resting colour.</p></div></article><article class="comp" id="c-input"><h3 class="h3">Input</h3><div class="stage"><div class="pdg-stack" style="align-items:flex-start">
  <div class="pdg-field">
