    <p class="caption pdg-field__hint" id="h2">Error: enter at least 5 minutes.</p>
  </div>
</div></div><div class="guide body"><p>A labelled single-line text field with optional hint or error message.</p>
<p><strong>Markup:</strong> a <code>.pdg-field</code> wrapping a <code>&lt;label class="caption pdg-field__label"&gt;</code>, an <code>&lt;input class="body pdg-input"&gt;</code> and an optional <code>&lt;p class="caption pdg-field__hint"&gt;</code>. Add <code>pdg-field--error</code> to the wrapper for the error state, and point <code>aria-describedby</code> at the hint.</p>
<p><strong>You provide:</strong> the label (always visible — placeholders are not labels), the <code>id</code>/<code>for</code> pairing, the value and validation message.</p>
<ul>
<li><code>surface</code> fill, <code>border-width</code> <code>border</code> outline, <code>radius-2</code>, <code>space-3</code> padding, <code>body</code> text; label in <code>caption</code> at weight 600, hint in <code>caption</code>; placeholder in <code>text-muted</code>.</li>
<li>Hover lifts the outline to <code>text-muted</code>; focus adds the <code>focus-ring-width</code> <code>primary</code> ring.</li>
