<li>Note: the <code>border</code> outline is 2.3:1 against <code>surface</code>, under 3:1; the visible label and <code>surface</code> fill carry the field's boundary alongside it.</li>
</ul></div></article><article class="comp" id="c-card"><h3 class="h3">Card</h3><div class="stage"><div class="pdg-stack" style="align-items:flex-start">
